[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_q88di"]
text = "Ah, you're right. Even if you have learned a skill, you can't use it unless the weapon you're using satisfies the skill's requirements. Therefore, you must consider the particularity of the weapon you're currently using for skills you're planning to learn. Also, you can choose weapons according to the skills you've learned and mastered."
